tracktion_engine v3.2 (the pinned submodule commit) predates some JUCE 8
AudioFormat API changes. This patch fixes `createWriterFor`'s signature
(unique_ptr return + AudioFormatWriterOptions) and a few related call sites
so it compiles against the vendored JUCE 8.0.12.

Apply inside the submodule after checkout:
    cd third_party/tracktion_engine
    git apply ../../plugins/stemdeck/tools/tracktion_engine_juce8_fixes.patch

This previously existed only as uncommitted local edits inside one worktree's
submodule checkout (nowhere in git history) — saved here so a fresh clone /
worktree can reproduce a working build.
